{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Takers is a third-person, team-based shooter where time is your lifeline\u2014and every second is earned, spent, or lost in combat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596040/extras/ff8b5f0d469638aed9e117be33c1b0cd.poster.avif?t=1762239314\" width=720 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596040/extras/ff8b5f0d469638aed9e117be33c1b0cd.webm?t=1762239314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596040/extras/ff8b5f0d469638aed9e117be33c1b0cd.mp4?t=1762239314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join a team of unique characters from across time and fight to collect Time Energy, a resource used to unlock and upgrade skills, revive teammates, or secure survival in a rapidly evolving battlefield.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every choice you make\u2014whether to grow stronger now or hold on for later\u2014shapes the flow of the match.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlike traditional hero shooters, Time Takers lets you break out of fixed roles.<br>Each character brings a unique ability, but your choice of weapons and apps completely transforms how you play \u2014 even with the same character.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596040/extras/b94ebee408a7f9a35174b6e51debf319.poster.avif?t=1762239314\" width=720 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596040/extras/b94ebee408a7f9a35174b6e51debf319.webm?t=1762239314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596040/extras/b94ebee408a7f9a35174b6e51debf319.mp4?t=1762239314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And you\u2019re not in this alone.<br>Team composition and coordination matter. The right mix of abilities, weapons, and timing can shift the momentum of a match and decide who\u2019s left standing.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Time Energy as both survival and growth currency</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build freely through your choice of weapons and passive apps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlast the competition in high-stakes team-based combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support your squad in fast-paced encounters by sharing time and reviving teammates under pressure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596040/extras/2cd15184c74becbd872e9d027a92933f.poster.avif?t=1762239314\" width=720 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596040/extras/2cd15184c74becbd872e9d027a92933f.webm?t=1762239314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596040/extras/2cd15184c74becbd872e9d027a92933f.mp4?t=1762239314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect it. Spend it. Share it. Survive it.<br>Every second counts in Time Takers.</strong></p><p class